Current validation fixture:

- `heliolinc_test_data.csv`: test dataset with 10 object groups and 100 detections per group. Heliolinc finds every group with 100/100 predictions

Object ID = GGGGNNNNIIIITTTT
GGGG = object group
NNNN = total objects in dataset
IIII = detection index within group
TTTT = total detections in group